  "title": "DWD ICON",
  "description": "An archive of global numerical weather prediction (NWP) model output from Deutscher Wetterdienst (DWD), Germany's national meteorological service, covering the ICON Global and ICON ART Global (aerosol and reactive trace gas) models. Includes ensemble and historical forecast runs, republished from GRIB2 into Zarr/Icechunk format.",
